    </expertiseList>
    <grid>
      <Value><![CDATA[{
  "name": "1 column layout",
  "sections": [
    {
      "grid": "12",
      "rows": [
        {
          "name": "Article Full",
          "id": "309e2d4b-2d7d-4f87-ba89-b73f65ff57bf",
          "areas": [
            {
              "grid": "12",
              "controls": [
                {
                  "value": "<p>To celebrate the end of the year, Roadlab branch managers were encourage to find community projects that resonated with them. This is four of those stories.</p>\n<p> </p>",
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "rte",
                    "view": "rte"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                },
                {
                  "value": {
                    "focalPoint": {
                      "left": 0.5,
                      "top": 0.5
                    },
                    "id": 2256,
                    "udi": "umb://media/9540e314aab046baafae162459c758be",
                    "image": "/media/clrfbfnq/mauritius-2.jpg"
                  },
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "media",
                    "view": "media"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                },
                {
                  "value": "<p><em>Mauritius is set to host the 2022 African Economic Conference (AEC) from this December.</em></p>",
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "rte",
                    "view": "rte"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                }
              ],
              "styles": null,
              "config": null
            }
          ],
          "styles": null,
          "config": null
        },
        {
          "name": "Article Full",
          "id": "87b51188-70a7-41cc-b36e-1ac1258ba7d4",
          "areas": [
            {
              "grid": "12",
              "controls": [
                {
                  "value": "<hr />\n<p> </p>",
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "rte",
                    "view": "rte"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                },
                {
                  "value": "<p><span class=\"heading-h3\">Wishes Do Come True<br /></span></p>\n<p>In July of this year Roadlab held a Winter Clothing Drive at our Head Office in Germiston.</p>\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\n<div>Over the previous two months our staff donated hundreds of items including clothing, shoes, bedding and tupperware.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\n<div></div>\n<div>We also hosted a pancake sale, the proceeds of which were used to buy almost 100 pairs of new winter socks.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\n<div></div>\n<div>All <a tabindex=\"-1\"></a>items were donated to the <a tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/avril.elizabeth.home/?__cft__[0]=AZVuDQErbnQRs8FSFPS8abVaVGY6jbgAdBRCWu2fsbLTsHTSJZrALGr-Z0ISkbq2RwOpzAlOi3pAbLyixHSWQ8zSLPoppZGFOiBVshBXtXQaq1yZIa6lDt90Y7DtSeKgB_o&amp;__tn__=kK-R\" class=\"x1i10hfl xjbqb8w x6umtig x1b1mbwd xaqea5y xav7gou x9f619 x1ypdohk xt0psk2 xe8uvvx xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x16tdsg8 x1hl2dhg xggy1nq x1a2a7pz xt0b8zv x1qq9wsj xo1l8bm\"><span class=\"xt0psk2\"><span>Avril Elizabeth Home for the Mentally Handicapped</span></span></a>, which supports 158 permanent residents within 2km of Roadlab's head office, and <a tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/ChildWelfareGermiston/?__cft__[0]=AZVuDQErbnQRs8FSFPS8abVaVGY6jbgAdBRCWu2fsbLTsHTSJZrALGr-Z0ISkbq2RwOpzAlOi3pAbLyixHSWQ8zSLPoppZGFOiBVshBXtXQaq1yZIa6lDt90Y7DtSeKgB_o&amp;__tn__=kK-R\" class=\"x1i10hfl xjbqb8w x6umtig x1b1mbwd xaqea5y xav7gou x9f619 x1ypdohk xt0psk2 xe8uvvx xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x16tdsg8 x1hl2dhg xggy1nq x1a2a7pz xt0b8zv x1qq9wsj xo1l8bm\"><span class=\"xt0psk2\"><span>Child Welfare Germiston</span></span></a>, which</div>\n<div>has been taking care of vulnerable children and their families since 1912.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\"></div>\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">This December we reached out to Child Welfare Germiston to find out if there was any way to support them during the holiday period and discovered their \"Make a Wish Come True\" campaign.</div>\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\"></div>\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">The focus of the \"Make a Wish Come True\" campaign is to give the children they support their dream Christmas gift this year. </div>\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\"></div>\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">The response to the campaign was incredible.</div>\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\"></div>\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\"Our Make A Wish Come True Campaign has received such an incredible outpouring of support, that we are blown away! We’ve had more pledges than we could have ever hoped for, and we have to say from the bottom of our hearts how very grateful we are! Because of you, some children out there who truly need something good will have a happy Christmas! Thank you all so much!\" - Child Welfare Germiston Facebook page</div>\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\"></div>\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">This week Roadlab donated some of the year's most commonly requested Christmas presents - cricket sets, soccer balls, dolls, cars - </div>\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\"></div>\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\"></div>\n<p> </p>",
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "rte",
                    "view": "rte"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                },
                {
                  "value": {
                    "focalPoint": {
                      "left": 0.5,
                      "top": 0.5
                    },
                    "id": 2255,
                    "udi": "umb://media/22068a41e3ad46dbbf6d50fb736d3477",
                    "image": "/media/i4famivn/mauritius-1.jpg"
                  },
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "media",
                    "view": "media"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                },
                {
                  "value": "<p><em>Mauritius is home to a major tourism industry and many major construction projects with international financing.</em></p>",
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "rte",
                    "view": "rte"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                }
              ],
              "styles": null,
              "config": null
            }
          ],
          "styles": null,
          "config": null
        },
        {
          "name": "Article Full",
          "id": "51c1cd0c-48b2-41a9-be33-9b4eecbe8a08",
          "areas": [
            {
              "grid": "12",
              "controls": [
                {
                  "value": "<hr />\n<p> </p>",
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "rte",
                    "view": "rte"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                },
                {
                  "value": "<p><span class=\"heading-h3\">A Champion from Primrose </span><span class=\"heading-h3\"></span></p>\n<p>A boxer from Edenvale's Rex Ultimate Boxing Gym.</p>\n<p>Spent much of his childhood visiting boxing gyms with his father, Charleton Koopman, whom he described as an inspiration and mentor.</p>\n<p>\"My father taught me everything I know and  learned a lot from him.\"</p>\n<p>Always attracted to boxing because of his father, Koopman loved all kinds of sports from a young age. He explained that being an athlete and being active is something he has already enjoyed.</p>\n<p>At 14 Koopman started his amateur boxing career and joined the Booysens Amateur Boxing Gym.</p>\n<p>He has represented SA in the Zone Four African Championship and participated in the SA championships later that year where he won a gold medal.</p>\n<p>He decided to turn professional in 2018. </p>\n<p>He hopes to one day obtain a world championship title and impress others. </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>",
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "rte",
                    "view": "rte"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                },
                {
                  "value": {
                    "focalPoint": {
                      "left": 0.5,
                      "top": 0.5
                    },
                    "id": 2259,
                    "udi": "umb://media/81e085cf4b9340be914efeae0b36ee4e",
                    "image": "/media/zgcpbamt/mauritius-5.jpg"
                  },
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "media",
                    "view": "media"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                },
                {
                  "value": "<p><em>Mauritius is home to over 1.2 million people, giving it the highest population density in Africa.<br /></em></p>",
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "rte",
                    "view": "rte"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                }
              ],
              "styles": null,
              "config": null
            }
          ],
          "styles": null,
          "config": null
        },
        {
          "name": "Article Full",
          "id": "a09ea291-87e5-448b-9f9f-5c8a51d12187",
          "areas": [
            {
              "grid": "12",
              "controls": [
                {
                  "value": "<hr />\n<p> </p>",
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "rte",
                    "view": "rte"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                },
                {
                  "value": "<p><span class=\"blog-h1 heading-h3\">Lephalale Old Age Home<br /></span></p>\n<p><strong>Anbalaba Development<br /></strong></p>\n<p>Roadlab contributed to various earthworks to help realise the recent successful development of an unobstructed view over the ocean and a lagoon for all of the villas of the Anbalaba development project, while protecting the raw landscape of beautiful Baie du Cap.</p>\n<p>Our site investigations helped to realise an exceptional view for the Anbalaba villas while maintaining total respect of the environment. As per their vision, Anbalaba favoured the installation of vegetated embankments and a retention basin rather than retaining walls and designed their drains to ensure that rainwater management respects the environment and the well-being of the local population.</p>",
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "rte",
                    "view": "rte"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                },
                {
                  "value": {
                    "focalPoint": {
                      "left": 0.5,
                      "top": 0.5
                    },
                    "id": 2255,
                    "udi": "umb://media/22068a41e3ad46dbbf6d50fb736d3477",
                    "image": "/media/i4famivn/mauritius-1.jpg"
                  },
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "media",
                    "view": "media"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                }
              ],
              "styles": null,
              "config": null
            }
          ],
          "styles": null,
          "config": null
        },
        {
          "name": "Article Full",
          "id": "60828878-8463-49e6-9ceb-5ac69265d469",
          "areas": [
            {
              "grid": "12",
              "controls": [
                {
                  "value": "<hr />\n<p> </p>",
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "rte",
                    "view": "rte"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                },
                {
                  "value": "<p><span class=\"heading-h3\">Mossel Bay Centre</span></p>\n<p><strong>Anbalaba Development<br /></strong></p>\n<p>Roadlab contributed to various earthworks to help realise the recent successful development of an unobstructed view over the ocean and a lagoon for all of the villas of the Anbalaba development project, while protecting the raw landscape of beautiful Baie du Cap.</p>\n<p>Our site investigations helped to realise an exceptional view for the Anbalaba villas while maintaining total respect of the environment. As per their vision, Anbalaba favoured the installation of vegetated embankments and a retention basin rather than retaining walls and designed their drains to ensure that rainwater management respects the environment and the well-being of the local population.</p>",
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "rte",
                    "view": "rte"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                },
                {
                  "value": {
                    "focalPoint": {
                      "left": 0.5,
                      "top": 0.5
                    },
                    "id": 2255,
                    "udi": "umb://media/22068a41e3ad46dbbf6d50fb736d3477",
                    "image": "/media/i4famivn/mauritius-1.jpg"
                  },
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "media",
                    "view": "media"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                }
              ],
              "styles": null,
              "config": null
            }
          ],
          "styles": null,
          "config": null
        },
        {
          "name": "Article Full",
          "id": "f695f4fd-0e3c-4d11-8624-d34f2df13458",
          "areas": [
            {
              "grid": "12",
              "controls": [
                {
                  "value": "<p> </p>\n<hr />\n<p> </p>\n<p><span class=\"heading-h3\">Interested in our work?</span><span class=\"heading-h3\"></span></p>",
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "rte",
                    "view": "rte"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                },
                {
                  "value": "<p><strong>Reach out to us at +230 5446 3700 </strong>or fill out the form below.</p>\n<p>Our Mauritius operations team is ready to assess your needs or arrange a site visit.</p>",
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "rte",
                    "view": "rte"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                }
              ],
              "styles": null,
              "config": null
            }
          ],
          "styles": null,
          "config": null
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}]]></Value>
    </grid>
    <heroContent>
      <Value><![CDATA[<p>Roadlab is an accomplished supporter of blue-chip companies, state enterprises, over 400 construction companies and more than 60 consulting firms across Africa.</p>]]></Value>
    </heroContent>
